// # emit-x86 string-int literal concat
//
// Logline: Print n= plus 7 so emit-x86 can lower STRING plus a const INT.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No ident bind.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Concat n= and 7.
//   3. Print the result.
//
// residual: general concat and ALU stay later.

pub fn main() {
    println("n=" + 7);
}
